      "difficulty_level": "H2",
      "difficulty_reason": "The authors construct skein state spaces and elementary 4-cobordism maps from modified traces and chromatic ribbon data, then verify surgery/handle relations to obtain a unique symmetric monoidal noncompact TQFT. The chromatic-compact hypothesis for extending to the full cobordism category is retained exactly. All coend, skein, surgery and cancellation arguments are included; closed-manifold and semisimple examples are not extra counted targets.",
